      "id": "W7221662901",
      "doi": "10.1364/oe.613193",
      "title": "Size-dependent effects of TMAH sidewall treatment for enhanced modulation bandwidth of GaN-based micro-LEDs",
      "authors": [
        "Sijia Wei",
        "Ying Gu",
        "Haowen Hua",
