      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Optics Express",
      "venue_abbr": "OE",
      "rank_label": "CIE T2 · 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "GaN micro-LEDs",
        "modulation bandwidth",
        "size effect",
        "sidewall passivation",
        "GaN-on-Si"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1364/oe.613193",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/a1d7344d-5936-46de-8d78-b8d892737bcd.html",
      "summary": "该实验研究比较了边长10、20和30 μm的GaN微LED经不同时间TMAH侧壁处理后的光电性能与调制特性。摘要报告，适当处理改善侧壁形貌和发光效率，并降低侧壁相关寄生电容。处理60 min后，10 μm器件的平均−3 dB带宽约为1.57 GHz，较未处理器件提高45%；20和30 μm器件的带宽对处理时间的依赖较弱。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
